    "id": "9caeda4e8ccc385d8698",
    "source": "Act at the table as your character, exactly as typing in the chat box: 'do' is an action, 'say' is speech, 'ooc' is out of character. The Game Master answers in the campaign. A cast that would end your character's running concentration spell is refused with confirmConcentration naming both spells; ask your player, and if they agree send the same action again with concentrationAck set to that object.",
